	<h1 itemprop="name" class="PostTitle"><a href="../magnesium-major-factor-in-hypertension/index.html">Magnesium: Major Factor in Hypertension</a></h1>
	<div class="BlockContent">
		<p class="NewsDate" style="margin: 0; color:#6e6e6e;">Posted by 
